103
00:04:08,959 --> 00:04:10,710
assumes the user can react within

104
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:12,710
whatever time the software decides is

105
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:15,589
reasonable. One example I absolutely

106
00:04:15,599 --> 00:04:17,990
