130
00:05:12,960 --> 00:05:15,350
jumps around, or the feature only works

131
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:18,230
for the simplest case. There is also a

132
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:20,629
legal and business side to this.

133
00:05:20,639 --> 00:05:22,150
Companies sometimes only take

134
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,990
