1144
00:44:21,839 --> 00:44:24,630
experiences. But mobile platforms can

1145
00:44:24,640 --> 00:44:26,470
also learn from Windows about the value

1146
00:44:26,480 --> 00:44:29,829
of automation APIs and keyboard access.

1147
00:44:29,839 --> 00:44:32,150
across all of them. The biggest lesson

1148
00:44:32,160 --> 00:44:34,069
