information harder to inspect, that is

1154
00:44:44,560 --> 00:44:46,390
not a small regression for assistive

1155
00:44:46,400 --> 00:44:49,190
technology users. All of them can do

1156
00:44:49,200 --> 00:44:50,950
better at involving disabled users

1157
00:44:50,960 --> 00:44:54,150
earlier, documenting APIs clearly and

1158
00:44:54,160 --> 00:44:55,990
