1165
00:45:11,280 --> 00:45:13,190
normal engineering requirement, not a

1166
00:45:13,200 --> 00:45:16,309
polishing task. Use semantic UI

1167
00:45:16,319 --> 00:45:17,990
components so the platform can tell

1168
00:45:18,000 --> 00:45:19,750
