1169
00:45:19,760 --> 00:45:22,710
and what it does. Keep a logical focus

1170
00:45:22,720 --> 00:45:25,270
order. Make sure every control has a

1171
00:45:25,280 --> 00:45:28,470
name, role, and state. support keyboard

1172
00:45:28,480 --> 00:45:30,870
and assisted technology navigation,

1173
00:45:30,880 --> 00:45:33,270
respect user settings like text size and

1174
00:45:33,280 --> 00:45:35,670
contrast, and test with screen readers

1175
00:45:35,680 --> 00:45:38,710
and switch control. Tab and enter are

1176
00:45:38,720 --> 00:45:41,109
your best friends. If you cannot get

1177
00:45:41,119 --> 00:45:42,630
through the main workflow with those

1178
00:45:42,640 --> 00:45:44,870
keys, that is a sign the structure of

1179
00:45:44,880 --> 00:45:47,510
the app needs work. Automated

1180
00:45:47,520 --> 00:45:49,589
accessibility checks are useful, but

1181
00:45:49,599 --> 00:45:52,390
they mostly catch obvious problems. They

1182
00:45:52,400 --> 00:45:53,990
