1189
00:46:07,200 --> 00:46:09,109
&gt;&gt; What can vendors do?

1190
00:46:09,119 --> 00:46:10,870
&gt;&gt; Vendors can provide better platform

1191
00:46:10,880 --> 00:46:13,589
APIs, better documentation, and better

1192
00:46:13,599 --> 00:46:16,630
